  "description": "Fix one of the most frustrating issues in paint correction jobs with Trim Clean Wax and Oil Lifting Spray. After a compound or polish pass, splatter and oily residue almost always finds its way into plastic trim, rubber gaskets and body cladding. The result is hazy white streaks that ruin an otherwise gorgeous correction job. This trim cleaner is engineered to break down trapped waxes, polish, and compound oils without scrubbing aggressively on delicate textured plastic. Spray onto the affected trim, agitate gently with a soft detail brush or microfiber towel, and wipe clean. The hazy white film comes up cleanly, leaving the trim looking dark, even, and in a ready-to-dress state. Trim Clean is also a smart prep step before any new trim dressing. Chemical Guys Wax and Grease Remover Spray works across the full build, including on exterior plastic vents and rubber trim. It is a great car detailing spray for car owners, DIY car enthusiasts, and detail professionals.",
